    ///**Here rather than in the view that makes them.** An undo stack belongs to the file: the 2D editor is
    ///destroyed and rebuilt every time somebody looks at the 3D view and comes back, and a stack that lived
    ///there went with it. It is also written into a session from here, which is what lets it outlive the
    ///page - see <see cref="restoreEdits"/>.
